WEBVTT

00:07.650 --> 00:12.070
Les Misérables

00:07.650 --> 00:12.070
A Girl Named Cosette

00:08.610 --> 00:11.610
Beyond the wind

00:12.070 --> 00:15.490
The wind blows

00:12.070 --> 00:15.490
Kaze ga fuki nuketeku

00:15.490 --> 00:22.120
over the daisies blooming over the stone pavement

00:15.490 --> 00:22.120
Ishidatami ni saku hinagiku

00:22.120 --> 00:25.670
I held my knees

00:22.120 --> 00:25.670
Hiza wo tsuite

00:25.670 --> 00:31.130
and gazed at the flowers

00:25.670 --> 00:31.130
Jitto mitsumeteta

00:31.130 --> 00:34.840
Far away, very far away

00:31.130 --> 00:34.840
Tooku haruka tooku

00:34.840 --> 00:41.470
A gentle voice is calling me

00:34.840 --> 00:41.470
Watashi wo yobu yasashii koe

00:41.470 --> 00:45.100
Let's go look for it

00:41.470 --> 00:45.100
Sagashii ni yukou

00:45.100 --> 00:50.860
Even if we wander aimlessly

00:45.100 --> 00:50.860
Attemonai keredo

00:50.860 --> 00:55.610
The rain comes down

00:50.860 --> 00:55.610
Doushaburi no ame

00:55.610 --> 01:00.370
on a lonely morning

00:55.610 --> 01:00.370
Hitoribocchi no asa

01:00.370 --> 01:04.870
But look, beyond the clouds

01:00.370 --> 01:04.870
Demo hora kumo no mukou

01:04.870 --> 01:09.460
the sunlight is peering at us

01:04.870 --> 01:09.460
Hizashi ga nozoiteruyo

01:09.460 --> 01:11.840
Wipe away your tears

01:09.460 --> 01:11.840
Namida fuite

01:11.840 --> 01:14.800
Look forward

01:11.840 --> 01:14.800
Mae wo muite

01:14.800 --> 01:19.100
and summon all of your strength

01:14.800 --> 01:19.100
Ashimoto chikara komete

01:19.100 --> 01:21.430
Let's walk

01:19.100 --> 01:21.430
Aruite yukou

01:21.430 --> 01:23.810
I'm sure we will make it

01:21.430 --> 01:23.810
Kitto yukeru

01:23.810 --> 01:31.190
The road, the road, continues on...

01:23.810 --> 01:31.190
Michi wa michi wa tsuzuku yo...

01:31.190 --> 01:34.240
forever...

01:31.190 --> 01:34.240
Dokomademo

01:59.270 --> 02:03.130
I never knew Fantine had a child...

02:03.820 --> 02:08.260
Geez, you don't know what she has done through her honest face.

02:08.570 --> 02:11.610
But, won't it be terrible if the factory forewoman gets wind of this?

02:11.740 --> 02:13.390
Who cares about that?

02:13.410 --> 02:15.680
She lied to all of us.

02:15.700 --> 02:17.180
What a horrible swindler.

02:17.540 --> 02:18.450
Without a doubt.

02:29.340 --> 02:30.950
She's so icy wherever she goes.

02:48.950 --> 02:53.110
If I can live together with Cosette, I can withstand anything that happens.

02:56.040 --> 02:58.890
Oh, that's right. It's her birthday soon.

03:01.170 --> 03:03.900
I will fetch her then.

03:04.830 --> 03:09.830
Cosette's Birthday

03:11.300 --> 03:12.530
"Boulangerie." (Bakery.)

03:16.770 --> 03:17.540
"Boucherie." (Butcher's shop.)

03:19.770 --> 03:21.040
"Poissonnerie." (Fishmonger.)

03:22.650 --> 03:25.290
You're amazing, Cosette. Did you learn all of them?

03:25.650 --> 03:26.960
I didn't learn all of them, though...

03:27.570 --> 03:30.670
I want to be able to write a letter to Mother soon.

03:31.200 --> 03:33.150
So, I have to remember many words.

03:33.450 --> 03:35.050
What are you going to write in the letter?

03:35.490 --> 03:37.470
I'm going to write, "Come and fetch me quickly."

03:38.950 --> 03:39.990
How about me?

03:40.660 --> 03:43.730
Of course! You and Chou Chou will come with me.

03:44.330 --> 03:44.900
Yeah!

03:46.550 --> 03:47.820
Eh? Where's Chou Chou?

03:51.010 --> 03:55.030
Chou Chou! Where are you going?! Hey, wait for me!

03:55.180 --> 03:56.950
Gavroche! Chou Chou!

03:57.390 --> 03:59.740
Hey, Chou Chou! Wait for me!

04:01.100 --> 04:04.890
Hey, if we don't go back soon, the mistress will scold us!

04:16.990 --> 04:17.850
How pretty...

04:20.660 --> 04:23.350
It has a nostalgic scent...

04:25.250 --> 04:26.650
Yay! Yay!

04:33.380 --> 04:34.110
Cosette.

04:38.850 --> 04:40.410
Happy birthday.

04:41.310 --> 04:42.910
My lovely princess.

04:48.480 --> 04:49.380
What's the matter?

04:51.230 --> 04:52.460
I remembered something.

04:53.990 --> 04:58.090
It's about the time when Mother celebrated my birthday.

04:58.830 --> 05:00.390
Your birthday?

05:01.540 --> 05:05.700
That time also had the same blooming violets like these.

05:07.670 --> 05:08.440
Chou Chou!

05:09.340 --> 05:10.730
You're giving this to me?

05:14.050 --> 05:15.900
He says it's your birthday present.

05:16.300 --> 05:17.450
Geez, Chou Chou.

05:42.080 --> 05:47.560
Is it you who said that you know when Mayor Madeleine came to this town?

05:50.090 --> 05:54.940
I have to state first that there isn't anyone in this
town who would criticize Monsieur Madeleine.

05:55.090 --> 05:57.740
Whatever. Just say it.

05:58.390 --> 06:02.780
I remember clearly the first time I meet Monsieur Madeleine.

06:04.560 --> 06:07.710
At that time, there was a devastating fire.

06:34.590 --> 06:38.030
He saved a military police commander's child.

06:38.680 --> 06:44.700
After that, Monsieur Madeleine settled down
in this town and was appointed the mayor.

06:45.180 --> 06:50.680
It's astonishing. In the chaos of the fire, all his identity documents were burnt.

06:50.900 --> 06:52.830
He started everything from scratch.

06:53.520 --> 06:57.520
His splendid demeanor is based on his background.

06:58.030 --> 07:02.010
You should stop trying to cast suspicion on him.

07:03.120 --> 07:05.430
So, this means his past is unknown.

07:17.010 --> 07:18.820
The buttons are gone...

07:29.390 --> 07:30.470
Please return them.

07:30.770 --> 07:33.790
What are you saying? Please stop your false accusations.

07:34.730 --> 07:40.480
I don't care about your gossip, but if you interfere
with my work, I won't be able to get my pay.

07:41.570 --> 07:43.900
So, what did I do?

07:44.320 --> 07:47.810
If you want to get your pay, why don't you sit down and do your work.

07:48.950 --> 07:50.100
Please return them!

07:51.290 --> 07:53.310
Didn't I say I don't know??

07:53.330 --> 07:54.160
Return them!

07:54.380 --> 07:55.650
You're annoying!

08:13.190 --> 08:14.500
This can't be! You're firing me...

08:14.940 --> 08:17.350
I will reimburse you for the buttons, so...

08:19.610 --> 08:22.300
You know the reason very well.

08:23.910 --> 08:25.590
I have never been late to work.

08:25.950 --> 08:29.640
I didn't take any leave even if I'm sick.

08:29.910 --> 08:32.980
I was working hard, so why are you firing...

08:33.580 --> 08:35.440
Do you not have a child?

08:37.040 --> 08:38.150
That's...

08:38.840 --> 08:40.650
You lied during the interview.

08:42.470 --> 08:48.840
I'm sorry for lying. However, if I had not
done that, you wouldn't have hired me.

08:49.470 --> 08:55.040
Your coworkers at the factory have also sounded
their objection of your personality.

08:56.690 --> 09:00.810
As the forewoman, I would like to avoid things like today's unfortunate incident.

09:02.530 --> 09:05.800
Please take your pay for today.

09:06.200 --> 09:08.010
You will not come tomorrow.

09:08.030 --> 09:08.930
Wait!

09:10.450 --> 09:12.280
If I lose this job now,

09:12.290 --> 09:14.730
I won't be able to live with Cosette.

09:15.420 --> 09:16.910
Even though I have come so far...

09:17.380 --> 09:18.350
Please let go of me.

09:18.840 --> 09:20.860
This is an order from Monsieur Madeleine.

09:22.880 --> 09:24.360
It cannot be from him.

09:24.380 --> 09:28.360
How can a compassionate mayor do such a cruel thing?

09:28.680 --> 09:30.840
In any case, it has already been decided.

09:41.070 --> 09:46.130
If he comes along with his intimidating face,
my shop won't be able to get any business.

09:46.700 --> 09:51.600
Can you, the mayor, convey this to Inspector Javert?

09:52.330 --> 09:53.970
I'm sorry that I brought you trouble.

09:54.000 --> 09:59.310
No, it's nothing. I don't feel that you have brought us any trouble.

09:59.790 --> 10:05.190
Rather! I'm more worried about that inspector
trying to sniff out about your past deeds.

10:07.470 --> 10:09.490
Thank you. I'm fine.

10:09.890 --> 10:11.030
That's without a doubt.

10:11.510 --> 10:16.910
How can you have done anything evil? The entire town believes you haven't.

10:19.150 --> 10:21.080
Well then, I shall excuse myself now.

10:21.560 --> 10:22.290
Okay.

10:33.870 --> 10:34.760
Monsieur Madeleine!

10:35.370 --> 10:36.930
What's the matter, Monsieur Madeleine?!

10:37.330 --> 10:38.560
Hang in there!

10:39.080 --> 10:39.770
It's okay.

10:41.250 --> 10:42.370
I'm all right.

10:49.510 --> 10:51.990
You should rest for a while.

10:52.800 --> 10:53.450
Sorry about this.

10:53.930 --> 10:54.580
Um...

10:55.470 --> 10:57.580
There is someone who is waiting for you.

10:59.100 --> 11:01.710
Monsieur Madeleine will not meet anyone today.

11:02.690 --> 11:04.000
Please turn them away.

11:14.330 --> 11:15.510
Where's Monsieur Madeleine?

11:16.200 --> 11:17.060
He said he can't see you.

11:17.330 --> 11:18.180
How can this be...

11:18.960 --> 11:20.680
Please! Just let me see him for a minute...

11:21.290 --> 11:23.150
The mayor is a busy person...

11:23.540 --> 11:27.070
I think he will understand once I explain everything to him.

11:27.260 --> 11:30.530
Please! Please let me see Monsieur Madeleine now!

11:31.510 --> 11:32.490
You're really persistent.

11:32.890 --> 11:34.740
If he can't see you, he can't see you!

12:14.430 --> 12:16.070
Can you let me work here?

12:16.720 --> 12:18.870
Do you have experience with sewing?

12:19.180 --> 12:21.700
Yes. Will you let me work here?

12:22.100 --> 12:26.420
But I will pay you only 12 sous per clothing.

12:28.940 --> 12:30.000
Please let me do it.

12:41.580 --> 12:43.390
Cosette is sick?!

12:43.920 --> 12:48.060
The doctor said she will recover if she drinks the medicine.

12:48.710 --> 12:52.360
Please send 40 francs right away to cover the cost of the medicine.

12:58.010 --> 12:59.280
40 francs...

13:01.520 --> 13:04.790
But she'll recover if she drinks the medicine. Thank goodness.

13:08.400 --> 13:11.210
How long can you take just to fetch water?!

13:15.820 --> 13:17.840
What are you doing, you dimwit?!

13:18.570 --> 13:19.720
Go and fetch another bucket!

13:21.040 --> 13:22.180
Yes.

13:28.040 --> 13:29.400
I know...

13:30.040 --> 13:34.860
...that Cosette always goes to the church to learn to
read from the priest while she's out on the streets.

13:35.090 --> 13:36.210
Is that true?

13:37.010 --> 13:39.200
Sheesh. She's such a cheeky girl.

13:39.220 --> 13:42.580
She doesn't do her work well; she is thinking
of slacking off from work all day long.

13:43.180 --> 13:46.830
Even if she learns to read, it would be of no use to her.

13:47.100 --> 13:50.040
Even if she learns, it would be of no use to her.

13:50.610 --> 13:51.840
Hey, come and see this!

13:53.150 --> 13:58.010
Fantine understood that Cosette is sick and immediately sent money.

13:59.570 --> 14:02.350
This means we still can milk her for all its worth.

14:02.870 --> 14:05.560
How does raising the monthly living expenses to 13 francs sound?

14:06.290 --> 14:09.440
We're taking care of an useless child.

14:09.790 --> 14:14.070
So, it isn't absurd for us to raise it up to 15 francs!

14:26.310 --> 14:26.950
Come in.

14:30.190 --> 14:31.540
Can we do our sewing together?

14:31.560 --> 14:32.880
Madame Marguerite!

14:33.520 --> 14:36.340
I saw you from the window.

14:36.860 --> 14:39.840
You're going to damage your eyesight if you don't light a candle.

14:40.910 --> 14:42.140
I'm sorry.

14:45.660 --> 14:51.310
It's nothing. I also have clothing that I have
to sew by tonight, so it's not a bother.

14:53.500 --> 14:54.770
Thank you very much.

14:55.090 --> 14:58.190
What's that? You don't have to shed tears for such a small matter.

14:59.720 --> 15:01.910
I've been holding this back all along...

15:02.260 --> 15:03.200
Is that so?

15:03.550 --> 15:08.540
When I thought I could finally fetch my
daughter, Cosette, during her birthday...

15:09.690 --> 15:13.040
I was fired by the factory and I couldn't find any decent jobs.

15:14.230 --> 15:15.710
I'm really a useless mother.

15:16.320 --> 15:19.170
No one will blame you.

15:22.240 --> 15:24.180
Is that for your daughter?

15:24.830 --> 15:27.310
I'm thinking of giving her a sachet for her birthday.

15:28.580 --> 15:31.560
And I would stuff a potpourri of flowers in it.

15:32.170 --> 15:34.190
I can only do this for her...

15:35.170 --> 15:37.540
Your daughter will definitely be grateful.

15:45.100 --> 15:45.990
Hey, see this!

15:46.350 --> 15:50.500
I don't know if Fantine has lost her mind, but she sent so much money over.

15:50.810 --> 15:53.210
The letter is really heavy, isn't it?

15:53.440 --> 15:53.920
See!

15:54.400 --> 15:57.420
Saying that Cosette is sick is really effective.

15:59.440 --> 16:00.260
What's this?

16:00.950 --> 16:01.920
What is she planning?

16:03.200 --> 16:07.760
It's written here: "Please give this sachet to Cosette for her birthday"!

16:08.540 --> 16:10.850
We got ripped off. What a bother.

16:11.080 --> 16:12.020
What's this thing?!

16:17.420 --> 16:18.570
It smells nice.

16:18.880 --> 16:21.820
I see. It has the same smell as the flowers from that time.

16:26.850 --> 16:29.300
What are you doing?! Doesn't that belong to Cosette?

16:29.430 --> 16:31.510
Don't smell it as you like! Return it!

16:32.100 --> 16:35.330
Gavroche, this is none of your business!

16:35.900 --> 16:38.960
Cosette, you haven't finished cleaning up the stables, right?!

16:39.480 --> 16:40.250
Hurry up and do it.

16:44.780 --> 16:48.110
My mother is going to give it to Éponine anyway.

16:49.540 --> 16:50.600
You're right.

16:50.950 --> 16:52.350
Cosette, are you fine with it?

16:53.710 --> 16:54.730
I can't help it.

16:55.750 --> 17:01.570
But Mother is concerned about me and even sent me a present.

17:02.300 --> 17:04.570
I'm happy with just that.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.700
Good morning, Toron.

17:13.980 --> 17:14.470
Huh?

17:14.940 --> 17:17.460
Éponine, you seem to smell really nice.

17:17.860 --> 17:21.880
Really? Could it be the scent of the sachet my mother made for me?

17:22.400 --> 17:23.630
You see.

17:24.320 --> 17:26.380
There are dried flowers in it.

17:29.990 --> 17:33.470
Huh? There's a card in it.

17:33.830 --> 17:36.390
You're right. I didn't notice it at all.

17:36.620 --> 17:37.690
What is written on it?

17:38.830 --> 17:40.560
Happy birthday...

17:42.880 --> 17:44.110
...Cosette.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.740
Doesn't this belong to Cosette?

17:46.970 --> 17:47.700
How can it be.

17:49.760 --> 17:51.530
I don't know about this.

17:52.010 --> 17:52.830
I'm telling the truth.

17:53.600 --> 17:55.540
This is so terrible!

17:55.940 --> 17:59.170
It's all because you gave me that thing!

17:59.400 --> 18:02.880
What on earth is the problem? I won't know if you keep on crying!

18:02.900 --> 18:06.510
They said it as if I took the sachet from Cosette.

18:06.610 --> 18:07.970
What did you say?!

18:08.240 --> 18:10.590
I didn't do anything wrong!

18:10.620 --> 18:14.310
Of course, you didn't do anything wrong at all.

18:14.330 --> 18:16.560
Cosette! You're unlucky charm!

18:17.000 --> 18:19.770
Because of you, I was so humiliated!

18:20.920 --> 18:22.770
That's my mother's sachet.

18:23.210 --> 18:26.990
Cosette! How dare you say that! How impudent!

18:27.630 --> 18:29.780
I threw that thing away on my way back!

18:31.430 --> 18:34.050
You threw it... away...

18:36.140 --> 18:36.870
Cosette!

18:59.290 --> 19:01.900
Is there anything else that is still lacking?

19:06.170 --> 19:08.940
How about putting a flower bed here?

19:09.550 --> 19:15.450
It might be unnecessary, but I hope that this
can become a place where patients can relax.

19:16.390 --> 19:19.410
This is important. I will arrange for it to be built immediately.

19:20.810 --> 19:22.000
Sister Simplice...

19:23.020 --> 19:27.630
I'm rather worried since Mayor Madeleine is ill.

19:28.940 --> 19:35.350
Lately, he is working for the town far harder
than before, as if he's possessed by something.

19:36.540 --> 19:38.350
Did something happen?

19:38.910 --> 19:39.520
No...

19:40.960 --> 19:44.120
I want to put effort into what I can do now so that I won't regret it.

19:45.130 --> 19:46.020
That's the only reason.

19:47.380 --> 19:48.900
But I have not done enough.

19:50.590 --> 19:52.990
<i>Yes... What will happen tomorrow?</i>

19:53.800 --> 19:57.240
<i>And if my present self wants to atone for my sins...</i>

19:58.100 --> 20:01.790
<i>I have to do as much as I can for the people.</i>

20:08.570 --> 20:11.510
Gavroche! Gavroche!

20:11.820 --> 20:14.470
Sheesh. Where did he go?!

20:14.870 --> 20:17.220
I'm worried, so I'll look for him!

20:17.790 --> 20:20.030
Stop joking! We're so busy right now!

20:20.660 --> 20:22.810
Keep quiet and bring these over.

20:29.260 --> 20:30.690
Did you find it, Chou Chou?!

20:34.840 --> 20:36.380
This isn't it, Chou Chou.

20:36.390 --> 20:40.080
Listen. Remember the scent of this flower again.

20:46.190 --> 20:48.290
You must find it this time, Chou Chou!

20:55.910 --> 20:57.010
Gavroche!

20:57.990 --> 21:00.070
Where did you go?! I was worried!

21:01.790 --> 21:04.230
What's the matter? You're all covered in dirt!

21:05.960 --> 21:07.690
We found it. See!

21:12.880 --> 21:16.670
Gavroche, you were looking for it all this time?

21:17.260 --> 21:18.570
Chou Chou and I were looking for it together!

21:21.470 --> 21:24.500
Thank you... Gavroche, Chou Chou!

21:40.950 --> 21:43.680
"Happy birthday, Cosette."

21:49.500 --> 21:50.400
Mother...

21:51.550 --> 21:52.270
Thank you...

21:58.550 --> 21:59.630
What's the matter?

22:00.050 --> 22:04.580
It's nothing... I seemed to have heard Cosette's voice just now.

22:13.470 --> 22:16.480
ma maman (my mother)

22:17.440 --> 22:20.650
I like you very much, Mother

22:17.440 --> 22:20.650
Daisukiyo nee okaasan

22:21.310 --> 22:24.690
I love you, Mother

22:21.310 --> 22:24.690
Aishiteru nee okaasan

22:25.320 --> 22:29.160
Your warm inviting scent

22:25.320 --> 22:29.160
Atataku ii nioi

22:29.160 --> 22:32.490
My precious mother

22:29.160 --> 22:32.490
Taisetsuna okaasan

22:33.330 --> 22:36.410
As long as you call out to me

22:33.330 --> 22:36.410
Yobikakeru sore dake de

22:37.370 --> 22:40.580
It brings me joy, Mother

22:37.370 --> 22:40.580
Ureshii no nee okaasan

22:41.290 --> 22:45.340
My only mother

22:41.290 --> 22:45.340
Kono sekai ni tatta hitori

22:45.340 --> 22:48.430
in this world

22:45.340 --> 22:48.430
Watashi no okaasan

22:49.760 --> 22:51.590
Hug me tightly

22:49.760 --> 22:51.590
Dakishimete gyutto

22:51.590 --> 22:53.600
Kiss me gently

22:51.590 --> 22:53.600
Kisu wo shitte sotto

22:53.600 --> 23:01.310
Always be by my side

22:53.600 --> 23:01.310
Itsudemo watashi no soba ni ite ne

23:01.810 --> 23:04.570
On the path lined with chestnut trees

23:01.810 --> 23:04.570
Maronie no michi

23:04.570 --> 23:09.530
we walk hand-in-hand

23:04.570 --> 23:09.530
Futari te wo tori aruku

23:09.530 --> 23:13.240
If we sing together,

23:09.530 --> 23:13.240
Isshoni utaeba

23:13.240 --> 23:17.410
we can have fun with just that.

23:13.240 --> 23:17.410
Tanoshii ne sore dake de

23:17.700 --> 23:21.620
Bathing in the sunlight filtering through the canopy

23:17.700 --> 23:21.620
Komorebi no naka yureru

23:21.620 --> 23:25.630
Your beautiful eyes

23:21.620 --> 23:25.630
Kirei na hitomi

23:25.630 --> 23:29.260
And that gentle smile

23:25.630 --> 23:29.260
Yawaraka na hohoemi de

23:29.260 --> 23:34.930
envelop me.

23:29.260 --> 23:34.930
Watashi wo tsutsumu no

23:39.680 --> 24:09.590
Preview

23:41.740 --> 23:45.350
Cosette has received the present her mother had sent. Thank goodness.

23:45.370 --> 23:48.180
But Fantine can't work in the factory. She's in trouble!

23:48.200 --> 23:50.180
Monsieur Madeleine fell sick just now.

23:50.210 --> 23:54.190
Someone said that "Les Misérables" means "the oppressed ones".

23:54.210 --> 23:57.730
"Oppress" is a difficult word, so everyone should look it up in the dictionary.

23:57.760 --> 23:59.570
And with that done, next episode is:

23:59.590 --> 24:00.900
Lost Éponine.

